  "content": "<h1>Kaleidoscope Cookery 森羅物語：廚房</h1><p>&gt; 一款為Minecraft增添沉浸式烹飪系統與美味食譜的模組，豐富您的烹飪冒險旅程。</p><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java Edition-brightgreen\" alt=\"Minecraft\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge | NeoForge-1.20.1 | 1.21.1-orange\" alt=\"Forge\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-BSD | CC BY--NC--SA 4.0-blue\" alt=\"License\"></p><h2>簡介</h2><p>這是一款專為Minecraft Java版開發的模組。本模組致力於為Minecraft帶來豐富的烹飪體驗與全新遊戲內容。</p><h2>特色功能</h2><ul>\n<li>🍳 全新烹飪系統</li>\n<li>🥘 豐富多樣的食譜</li>\n<li>🔥 創新烹飪設備</li>\n<li>🎮 沉浸式遊戲體驗</li>\n</ul><h2>圖片展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/986/5ae6ae67-e2c4-468b-b101-9d469d3da9ab-png.png\" alt=\"img\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/987/7f2786df-734e-47aa-9996-02a20c1d2e69-png.png\" alt=\"img\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/988/14c5d260-7ec2-4766-ae8f-6c00188a7d24-png.png\" alt=\"img\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/989/ce2a393a-d1a3-4b08-a13c-86842d87cd30-png.png\" alt=\"img\">\n<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1257/990/ddfccb67-9b6a-47e3-94d5-349bb0a31d2e-png.png\" alt=\"img\"></p><h2>授權協議</h2><p>本專案採用雙重授權協議：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>原始碼</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/blob/main/LICENSE-CODE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSD 3-Clause License</a></li>\n<li><strong>資源檔案</strong>：<a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/blob/main/LICENSE-ASSETS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul><h2>意見回饋與建議</h2><p>若您在使用過程中遇到問題或有改進建議，歡迎透過以下方式與我們聯繫：</p><ul>\n<li>🐛 <a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 提交錯誤回報</li>\n<li>💡 <a href=\"https://github.com/KaleidoscopeMods/KaleidoscopeCookery/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 功能建議、討論交流</li>\n</ul><h2>開發團隊</h2><p><strong>Kaleidoscope 官方製作團隊</strong></p><hr><p>*感謝所有為本專案貢獻的開發者與玩家！*</p>",
